# Open this in VS Code with the REST Client extension and hit "Send Request"
# above each block. Saves needing the frontend to poke at any of this.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### is it alive
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### the whole book
GET {{base}}/shipments

### only the ones stuck in customs
GET {{base}}/shipments?status=CUSTOMS_HOLD

### find a file by reference, punctuation and case do not matter
GET {{base}}/shipments?q=ngk-imp-2026-0431

### a status that does not exist should be rejected, not come back empty
GET {{base}}/shipments?status=PENDING

### second page
GET {{base}}/shipments?limit=5&offset=5&sort=eta&dir=asc

### open a new file
POST {{base}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceNo": "NGK/IMP/2026/0492",
  "houseBlNo": "NGKH2604922",
  "masterBlNo": "MAEU771990412",
  "mode": "SEA_FCL",
  "originPort": "aejea",
  "destinationPort": "innsa",
  "consignee": "Test Importer Pvt Ltd",
  "incoterm": "CIF",
  "eta": "2026-10-14"
}

### same reference again, should come back 409 DUPLICATE_REFERENCE
POST {{base}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "referenceNo": "ngk-imp-2026-0492",
  "mode": "SEA_FCL",
  "originPort": "AEJEA",
  "destinationPort": "INNSA",
  "consignee": "Test Importer Pvt Ltd"
}

### one file — paste an id from the list above
@id = paste-an-id-here

GET {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}

### its history
GET {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}/events

### move it on
POST {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "DOCS_RECEIVED",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### an illegal jump, should be 409 ILLEGAL_TRANSITION with the allowed list
POST {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "DELIVERED",
  "expectedVersion": 2
}

### a hold with no reason, should be 422 on the remarks field
POST {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "CUSTOMS_HOLD",
  "expectedVersion": 2
}

### a stale version, should be 409 VERSION_CONFLICT
POST {{base}}/shipments/{{id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toStatus": "IN_TRANSIT",
  "expectedVersion": 1
}
